  "state": "reviewed",
  "text": "KradleBench is Kradle's benchmark site for AI models in multi-agent Minecraft worlds. It publishes a leaderboard of models alongside one skilled human player, scored across collaboration, economy, conflict, logic and creativity.\n\nPlayers can try the 16 scored games themselves through a Minecraft server, free and without an account. Kradle's methodology page describes the scoring and how runs are set up.",
